msgid "Couldn't reach DUPR. Please try again in a moment."
msgstr "无法连接 DUPR，请稍后重试。"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:477
msgid "Create one at mydupr.com or in the DUPR app"
msgstr "可在 mydupr.com 或 DUPR 应用中创建"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:446
msgid "Disconnect DUPR"
msgstr "解除 DUPR 关联"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:497
msgid "Disconnect DUPR?"
msgstr "解除 DUPR 关联？"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:474
msgid "Don't have a DUPR account?"
msgstr "还没有 DUPR 账号？"

#: src/components/molecules/DuprRatingBadge.re.mjs:55
msgid "doubles"
msgstr "双打"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:426
msgid "DUPR"
msgstr "DUPR"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:321
msgid "DUPR ID"
msgstr "DUPR ID"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:152
#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:489
msgid "DUPR linking isn't available right now."
msgstr "DUPR 关联暂时不可用。"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:392
msgid "DUPR login"
msgstr "DUPR 登录"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:187
msgid "DUPR sent something we couldn't read. Please try again."
msgstr "DUPR 返回的数据无法识别，请重试。"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:297
msgid "Last synced"
msgstr "上次同步"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:334
msgid ""
"Link your DUPR account to use your verified DUPR rating here. While it's "
"linked, it replaces your self-rating."
msgstr ""
"关联你的 DUPR 账号，即可在此使用已验证的 DUPR 评级。关联期间将替代你的自评"
"分。"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:266
msgid "Linked"
msgstr "已关联"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:271
msgid "Linking"
msgstr "关联中"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:363
msgid "Linking your account…"
msgstr "正在关联账号…"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:387
msgid "Loading DUPR…"
msgstr "正在加载 DUPR…"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:378
#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:460
msgid "Log in with DUPR"
msgstr "使用 DUPR 登录"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:274
#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:278
msgid "Not linked"
msgstr "未关联"

#: src/components/molecules/DuprRatingBadge.re.mjs:26
msgid "NR"
msgstr "无评级"

#: src/components/molecules/DuprRatingBadge.re.mjs:37
msgid "provisional"
msgstr "临时"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:381
msgid ""
"Sign in to DUPR to link your account. We store your DUPR ID and ratings — "
"never your DUPR password."
msgstr ""
"登录 DUPR 以关联账号。我们仅保存你的 DUPR ID 和评级，绝不保存 DUPR 密码。"

#: src/components/molecules/DuprRatingBadge.re.mjs:69
msgid "singles"
msgstr "单打"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:150
msgid "That DUPR account is already linked to another player."
msgstr "该 DUPR 账号已关联到其他球员。"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:154
msgid "That DUPR sign-in has expired. Please try again."
msgstr "该 DUPR 登录已过期，请重试。"

#: src/components/organisms/DuprConnectCard.re.mjs:498
msgid ""
"Your DUPR rating will stop being used here and your self-rating picker comes "
"back."
msgstr "此处将不再使用你的 DUPR 评级，自评分选择器将恢复显示。"
